{"3509380":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"GrimKeep","steam_appid":3509380,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GrimKeep is a roguelite dice-builder in a nightmare fairytale. Find items, roll your dice, and optimize your build to fire off massive damage. Cut through the horrors in the cursed city to get to the Princess. Then end her.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3509380\/extras\/7a96873bd64c32a228041adad0048927.poster.avif?t=1792426599\" width=1170 height=652 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3509380\/extras\/7a96873bd64c32a228041adad0048927.webm?t=1792426599\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3509380\/extras\/7a96873bd64c32a228041adad0048927.mp4?t=1792426599\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Big Damage Isn't Rolled. It's Built.<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find items<\/strong> and try out different combinations for maximum damage.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Roll the dice<\/strong> for powerful combos that fire off your items’ bonuses and multipliers.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tune your bag <\/strong>by acquiring dice with special abilities such as poison, healing or gold.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Further enhance your build at the Crucible. <\/strong>Melt items and their abilities into something new.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Outsmart the enemies<\/strong> by tactically using your defense, stuns, and heals. Your strategy determines how far you will make it.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use what you learned<\/strong> to optimize your next run, or try a totally different build.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3509380\/extras\/b4f7c828820d5ebc7b5f7dae06ceee06.poster.avif?t=1792426599\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3509380\/extras\/b4f7c828820d5ebc7b5f7dae06ceee06.webm?t=1792426599\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3509380\/extras\/b4f7c828820d5ebc7b5f7dae06ceee06.mp4?t=1792426599\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Rotten Nightmare Fairytale<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city is cursed and you must do what you can to set things right.<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your path<\/strong> on the map and assess the risks and rewards at every crossroads.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are the hero of this fairytale<\/strong>. Play as The Huntress or The Beast and unlock more characters as you progress. Each with unique strengths to build and tune around.<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take a chance<\/strong> at encounters with curious strangers in the city. You may or may not regret it.<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3509380\/extras\/2e2a54962257e00099e1498dcce53681.poster.avif?t=1792426599\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3509380\/extras\/2e2a54962257e00099e1498dcce53681.webm?t=1792426599\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3509380\/extras\/2e2a54962257e00099e1498dcce53681.mp4?t=1792426599\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What’s In the Game<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >200+ items with endless combinations<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >60+ unique monsters<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 playable heroes<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 dice types<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 hero skills to unlock<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3509380\/extras\/66f17d6e7bb1b2a0506fbf74d0ed4c68.poster.avif?t=1792426599\" width=1170 height=664 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3509380\/extras\/66f17d6e7bb1b2a0506fbf74d0ed4c68.webm?t=1792426599\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3509380\/extras\/66f17d6e7bb1b2a0506fbf74d0ed4c68.mp4?t=1792426599\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Made With Love<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GrimKeep is made by a small dev team and we’re pouring our hearts into this game! We love to share our (sometimes chaotic) journey with you and always appreciate hearing what you think.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GrimKeep is a roguelite dice-builder in a nightmare fairytale. Find items, roll your dice, and optimize your build to fire off massive damage. Cut through the horrors in the cursed city to get to the Princess. Then end her.<\/p><h2 class=\"b