 >60+ unique monsters<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 playable heroes<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 dice types<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 hero skills to unlock<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3509380\/extras\/66f17d6e7bb1b2a0506fbf74d0ed4c68.poster.avif?t=1792426599\" width=1170 height=664 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3509380\/extras\/66f17d6e7bb1b2a0506fbf74d0ed4c68.webm?t=1792426599\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3509380\/extras\/66f17d6e7bb1b2a0506fbf74d0ed4c68.mp4?t=1792426599\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Made With Love<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >GrimKeep is made by a small dev team and we’re pouring our hearts into this game! We love to share our (sometimes chaotic) journey with you and always appreciate hearing what you think.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p>","short_description":"GrimKeep is a roguelite dice-builder in a nightmare fairytale. Find items, roll your dice, and optimize your build to fire off massive damage. Cut through the horrors in the cursed city to get to the Princess. Then end her.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Swedish, Ukrainian, Japanese, Korean, Traditional Chinese, Polish, Turkish<br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3509380\/279078e15a06e12b0065475534db7e94b0d2528c\/header.jpg?t=1792426599","capsule_image":"ht