:"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 13 Ventura or later<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Apple M1 or later<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Apple M1 GPU or better<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> TBD<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> TBD<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> TBD MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> TBD<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"legal_notice":"Copyrights and trademarks are property of their respective owners."}}}